现在我们来了解什么是 GFCI，也就是接地故障断路器。

6
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:27,640
So ground fault happens when the seed tool or electrical system breaks in low resistance grounding path
接地故障是在工具或电气系统的低电阻接地路径断开时发生的，

7
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:34,240
At that time the electrical current can take the alternative path to go into the ground
这时电流可能会走另一条路径流入大地，

8
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,880
That too through the user
而且是经过使用者，

9
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:39,880
Because of which serious injury or death can also happen
因此可能造成重伤甚至死亡。

10
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:46,000
GFCI i.e. Ground fault circuit interrupter is a fast acting circuit breaker
GFCI 也就是接地故障断路器，是一种快速动作的断路器，

11
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:54,560
In which in the state of ground fault a 1 by 40 second light is designed to be switched off
在发生接地故障时，它被设计成能在 1/40 秒内切断电源，

12
00:00:54,560 --> 00:01:02,800
When the amount of current comes in, means the amount of current is approximately 5 mA
当电流量出现差值，也就是电流差约为 5 mA 时，

13
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:09,200
If the difference comes in, then the GFCI interrupters there
如果出现了这个差值，GFCI 就会在那里切断电路，

14
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:14,560
To prevent the electrical incident, GFCI is rotated there
为了防止发生触电事故，GFCI 会在那里动作，

15
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:17,680
That is, it quickly trips there because of it
也就是它会因此在那里迅速跳闸。

16
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:21,040
If we install it properly or maintain it
如果我们正确地安装或维护它，

17
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:27,680
Then as soon as we plug in the faulty tool, it works quickly
那么一旦我们插上有故障的工具，它就会迅速起作用。

18
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:33,200
GFCI i.e. it will not protect you from the line contact hazards
GFCI 也就是说，它不能保护你免受线间接触危害，

19
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:37,680
